{"id":"steam-1064300","steam":1064300,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Definitely a Unicorn","summary":"Startup chaos for 1–4 players, solo or online co-op. Everyone is a co-founder and everyone thinks they're the CEO. Ship it half-baked, bluff investors, fight over the last dollars. Become a unicorn — or a meme.","about":"Definitely a Unicorn is a co-op game about a startup you and your friends try to drag to success before the money runs out. You have an empty office, a brilliant idea and a bank account that burns fast. The rest is up to you.\n\nEveryone is a co-founder\r\nAnd everyone is sure they're in charge. Decisions land on every phone at once, and whoever answers first has decided for the company. Talking it over first is optional. Recommended, though.\n\nWho is actually paying you?\r\nA crowd of users or a couple of fat clients? The crowd brings noise, memes and burning servers. The clients bring contracts, deadlines and promises one of you has already made.\n\nShip it now or do it properly\r\nHalf-baked ships fast. The bugs get found later, by your users, at the worst possible moment.\n\nThey will remember you\r\nInvestors, clients and journalists remember what you promised and how it turned out. Next time, they treat you accordingly.\n\nBurn rate\r\nRent, salaries, servers. When the account runs dry you beg, cut, or finally sell something. Or somebody.\n\nDifferent every time\r\nA different niche, a different market, a different rival — and an entirely different disaster. One thing never changes: someone will bring up exactly where you screwed up.\n\nOne session takes about two hours, solo or with up to four players. At the end you find out what you became: a unicorn, survivors, or a cautionary tale.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064300/91050ce17648d0657ca9671c7425595095fd5158/library_capsule.jpg?t=1791383371","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064300/0cb9